       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. RECONCILE.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01 INTERNAL-TOTAL PIC 9(10)V99.
       01 EXTERNAL-TOTAL PIC 9(10)V99.
       01 TOLERANCE      PIC 9(10)V99.
       01 VARIANCE       PIC S9(11)V99.
       01 ABS-VARIANCE   PIC 9(11)V99.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

           DISPLAY "ENTER INTERNAL TOTAL:"
           ACCEPT INTERNAL-TOTAL

           DISPLAY "ENTER EXTERNAL TOTAL:"
           ACCEPT EXTERNAL-TOTAL

           DISPLAY "ENTER TOLERANCE:"
           ACCEPT TOLERANCE

           COMPUTE VARIANCE =
               INTERNAL-TOTAL - EXTERNAL-TOTAL
           IF VARIANCE < 0
               COMPUTE ABS-VARIANCE = 0 - VARIANCE
           ELSE
               MOVE VARIANCE TO ABS-VARIANCE
           END-IF

           DISPLAY "VARIANCE: " VARIANCE
           IF ABS-VARIANCE <= TOLERANCE
               DISPLAY "MATCH"
           ELSE
               DISPLAY "INVESTIGATE"
           END-IF

           STOP RUN.